@startuml
title Diagrama de Componentes - ms-proveedores

!define COMPONENT(x) component x

package "Cliente" {
  COMPONENT(ClienteAPI) as "Cliente API"
}

package "ms-proveedores" {
  COMPONENT(APIGateway) as "API Gateway\nFastAPI"
  COMPONENT(MiddlewareComp) as "Middleware\nLogging/Error"
  COMPONENT(RoutesComp) as "Routes\n(app/routes)"
  COMPONENT(ServicesComp) as "Servicios\n(app/services)"
  COMPONENT(ModelsComp) as "Modelos ORM\n(app/models)"
  COMPONENT(DependenciesComp) as "Dependencias\n(app/dependencies)"
  COMPONENT(SchemasComp) as "Schemas Pydantic\n(app/schemas)"
  COMPONENT(ClientsComp) as "Clientes HTTP\n(app/clients)"
  COMPONENT(UtilsComp) as "Utilidades\n(app/utils)"
  COMPONENT(ConfigComp) as "Configuracion\n(app/config)"
}

database "PostgreSQL" {
  COMPONENT(DBComp) as "Base de Datos"
}

package "Microservicios Externos" {
  COMPONENT(MSAuth) as "ms-autenticacion"
  COMPONENT(MSRoles) as "ms-roles"
  COMPONENT(MSAudit) as "ms-auditoria"
  COMPONENT(MSNotif) as "ms-notificaciones"
}

ClienteAPI --> APIGateway : HTTP/REST

APIGateway --> MiddlewareComp : usa
MiddlewareComp --> RoutesComp : procesa

RoutesComp --> DependenciesComp : valida
RoutesComp --> ServicesComp : invoca

DependenciesComp --> ClientsComp : verifica
DependenciesComp --> ConfigComp : obtiene config

ServicesComp --> ModelsComp : CRUD
ServicesComp --> ClientsComp : consume

ModelsComp --> DBComp : persiste
DBComp --> ModelsComp : retorna

RoutesComp --> SchemasComp : valida entrada
ServicesComp --> SchemasComp : mapea datos
RoutesComp --> UtilsComp : genera response

ClientsComp --> MSAuth : valida sesion
ClientsComp --> MSRoles : valida permisos
ClientsComp --> MSAudit : registra
ClientsComp --> MSNotif : envia alertas

note right of MiddlewareComp
Maneja logging, 
CORS, manejo de errores
end note

note right of DependenciesComp
Validacion transversal:
- Sesion (ms-auth)
- Permisos (ms-roles)
- Auditoria (ms-audit)
end note

note right of ClientsComp
Comunicacion con
microservicios externos
end note

@enduml
